<Base lang="en" title="Suppliers and partners" description="Ploos AS welcomes hardware manufacturers and distributors interested in Norway."><section class="wrap hero"><h1>Suppliers & partners</h1><p class="lead">Ploos AS is establishing HackShack as a specialized Norwegian sales channel for Linux-compatible hardware, mini PCs, networking equipment and single-board computers. We welcome discussions with manufacturers and distributors about evaluation orders, resale and long-term partnerships.</p><p>We aim to offer hands-on technical testing, clear documentation and Norwegian-language customer support.</p><p><a href="/en/contact/">Send a business enquiry via our contact form →</a></p></section></Base>
